<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Gitlab on ianhuang筆記</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/tags/gitlab/</link><description>Recent content in Gitlab on ianhuang筆記</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://iankingh.github.io/blog/tags/gitlab/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>GitHub／GitLab Issue 管理：提報指南、Markdown 錨點與 Issue 範本</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/github-gitlab-issue-management/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/github-gitlab-issue-management/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;收到 Bug 回報時，最常需要追問的是版本、操作步驟，以及實際結果。可以在專案放一份「提報 Issue 前請先看」指南，用 Markdown 錨點和表格引導讀者選對範本，再由範本提示要填哪些資訊。原始案例把 Bug 回報、功能建議和一般討論導向不同入口。&#10;&lt;a href="https://github.com/xingkongliang/skills-manager/issues/155" title="skills-manager 的置頂 Issue #155" rel="noopener external nofollow noreferrer" target="_blank" class=" exturl"&gt;&#10; skills-manager 的置頂 Issue #155&#10; &#10; &lt;i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>GitLab 認證失敗：HTTPS 憑證與 SSH 診斷</title><link>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/gitlab-error/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2020 16:36:13 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://iankingh.github.io/blog/post/git/gitlab-error/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;補上 token、認證快取與 SSH 的核對順序，區分 401、403、憑證和網路問題。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>